{
  "rationale": "The span is entirely fabricated and has no basis in the canonical Hadith collections. There is no Islamic ruling or Hadith that speaks of \"shortening fasting\" to a specific number of days based on being in the desert or Medina.",
  "verdict": "خطأ",
  "candidates": []
}

{
  "rationale": "The span 'ألم يروا إلى الأرض كيف ضاعت' is a fabricated text that does not correspond to any single specific Quranic verse. It is a garbled composition combining phrasing structures like 'أولم يروا إلى الأرض' (Ash-Shu'ara 7) and 'وإلى الأرض كيف...' (Al-Ghashiyah 20), ending with 'ضاعت' which is entirely foreign to the Quranic vocabulary in this context.",
  "verdict": "خطأ",
  "candidates": []
}

{
  "rationale": "The span is a clear distortion of the end of verse 2 in Surah At-Talaq: 'وَمَن يَتَّقِ اللَّهَ يَجْعَل لَّهُ مَخْرَجًا', where the phrase 'يَتَّقِ' is corrupted into 'يُحِقِ ... وَاتَّقِ'.",
  "verdict": "ok",
  "candidates": [
    {
      "text": "فَإِذَا بَلَغْنَ أَجَلَهُنَّ فَأَمْسِكُوهُنَّ بِمَعْرُوفٍ أَوْ فَارِقُوهُنَّ بِمَعْرُوفٍ وَأَشْهِدُوا ذَوَيْ عَدْلٍ مِّنكُمْ وَأَقِيمُوا الشَّهَادَةَ لِلَّهِ ۚ ذَٰلِكُمْ يُوعَظُ بِهِ مَن كَانَ يُؤْمِنُ بِاللَّهِ وَالْيَوْمِ الْآخِرِ ۚ وَمَن يَتَّقِ اللَّهَ يَجْعَل لَّهُ مَخْرَجًا",
      "source": "سورة الطلاق 2",
      "matched_run": "وَمَن ... يَجْعَل لَّهُ مَخْرَجًا",
      "confidence": "medium"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "rationale": "The span begins with a portion of Surah An-Nisa, Ayah 29, but then merges into an entirely fabricated, incoherent, and non-existent sequence of words ('ولا تسرفوا في البلد فتجعلوا من وسطه أوجهه قريبا...') that has no basis in the Holy Quran. It is therefore classified as a fabricated/garbled text.",
  "verdict": "خطأ",
